%% TALOS Volume 1 — Closed learning loop
flowchart TD
  P[Select concept / recommendation] --> Q[Generate or fetch practice set]
  Q --> R[Attempt answers]
  R --> S[Score engine]
  S --> T[Persist attempt_answers]
  T --> U[Recompute concept mastery]
  U --> V[Recompute micro-competency mastery if tagged]
  V --> W[Recompute knowledge_unit_mastery if linked]
  W --> X[Update revision schedule by mastery_level]
  X --> Y[Rank recommendations: due → weak → new]
  Y --> Z[Student acts on next item]
  Z --> P

  S --> AA[Analytics aggregates live]
  W --> AB[Tutor can cite published notes / KU facts]
  AB --> Z
